SUMMARY:Twin Falls Loop - 7 Miles\, 800' elevation gain
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nLength: 7 miles\nElevation gain: 8
 00'\nDifficulty: moderat\npace: 2-2.5mph\n\nWith all the rain lately it se
 emed appropriate to do a waterfall hike. We'll meet at the Pisgah Ranger S
 tation middle parking lot at 8:45\, leaving at 9:00 sharp.\nIf you plan on
  meeting at the trail head please let me know in the comments.\n\nWe'll dr
 ive to the Buckhorn Gap trailhead\, follow Buckhorn Gap to Twin Falls. We'
 ll break at the falls and then continue back on Buckhorn Gap to Clawhammer
  Rd. Follow the road to Clawhammer trail down to Avery Creek Trail. Take A
 very Creek back to Buckhorn Gap and then back to the cars.\n\nDogs are wel
 come. I'll have my dog with me.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315016819
 /
